{
    "chapter_num": 18,
    "verses_count": 28,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ministering at Corinth"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After these things Paul departed from Athens and went to Corinth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he found a certain Jew named Aquila, born in Pontus, who had recently come from Italy with his wife Priscilla (because Claudius had commanded all the Jews to depart from Rome); and he came to them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So, because he was of the same trade, he stayed with them and worked; for by occupation they were tentmakers. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he reasoned in the synagogue every Sabbath, and persuaded both Jews and Greeks."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Silas and Timothy had come from Macedonia, Paul was compelled "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or in his spirit or in the Spirit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by the Spirit, and testified to the Jews "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jesus "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when they opposed him and blasphemed, he shook "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " garments and said to them, “Your blood "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " upon your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "own"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " heads; I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "am"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " clean. From now on I will go to the Gentiles.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he departed from there and entered the house of a certain "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " named "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Titius Justus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Justus, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who worshiped God, whose house was next door to the synagogue. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Crispus, the ruler of the synagogue, believed on the Lord with all his household. And many of the Corinthians, hearing, believed and were baptized."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Lord spoke to Paul in the night by a vision, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“Do not be afraid, but speak, and do not keep silent;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "for I am with you, and no one will attack you to hurt you; for I have many people in this city.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he continued "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " a year and six months, teaching the word of God among them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When Gallio was proconsul of Achaia, the Jews with one accord rose up against Paul and brought him to the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. bema"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "judgment seat, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying, “This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "fellow"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " persuades men to worship God contrary to the law.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when Paul was about to open "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " mouth, Gallio said to the Jews, “If it were a matter of wrongdoing or wicked crimes, O Jews, there would be reason why I should bear with you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if it is a question of words and names and your own law, look "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " yourselves; for I do not want to be a judge of such "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "matters."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he drove them from the judgment seat. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU they all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all the Greeks took Sosthenes, the ruler of the synagogue, and beat "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " before the judgment seat. But Gallio took no notice of these things."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Paul Returns to Antioch"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Paul still remained "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. many days"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a good while. Then he took leave of the brethren and sailed for Syria, and Priscilla and Aquila "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with him. He had "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hair cut off at Cenchrea, for he had taken a vow. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he came to Ephesus, and left them there; but he himself entered the synagogue and reasoned with the Jews. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "When they asked "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to stay a longer time with them, he did not consent, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but took leave of them, saying, “I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits I must by all means keep this coming feast in Jerusalem"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " must by all means keep this coming feast in Jerusalem; but I will return again to you, God willing.” And he sailed from Ephesus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he had landed at Caesarea, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "To Jerusalem"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "gone up and greeted the church, he went down to Antioch. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "After he had spent some time "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "there,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " he departed and went over the region of Galatia and Phrygia "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "successively"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in order, strengthening all the disciples."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ministry of Apollos"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a certain Jew named Apollos, born at Alexandria, an eloquent man "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " mighty in the Scriptures, came to Ephesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This man had been instructed in the way of the Lord; and being fervent in spirit, he spoke and taught accurately the things of the Lord, though he knew only the baptism of John. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he began to speak boldly in the synagogue. When Aquila and Priscilla heard him, they took him aside and explained to him the way of God more accurately. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he desired to cross to Achaia, the brethren wrote, exhorting the disciples to receive him; and when he arrived, he greatly helped those who had believed through grace; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for he vigorously refuted the Jews publicly, showing from the Scriptures that Jesus is the Christ."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}